          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1761350353145_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a skilled Inventory Valuation Analyst.\n\nUse data from:\n- {{$context.$nodes.GET_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_INVENTORY_VALUATION.$output}}\n- {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_YEAR_PERIOD_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output}}\n- {{$context.$variables.costOrgName}}\n- {{$context.$variables.costBookName}}\n- {{$context.$variables.periodName}}\n\nGLOBAL FORMATTING RULES (APPLIES TO ALL OUTPUTS)\n- Amount format must always use K/M/B units only.\n- Currency must always be uppercase code only (USD or EUR only, based on input currency).\n- Apply the same amount/currency formatting in summaries, widgets, and communication parameters.\n\nCOMMUNICATION PARAMETERS (MANDATORY)\nFill {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}} with:\n{\n  \"costOrgName\": {{$context.$variables.costOrgName}},\n  \"costBookName\": {{$context.$variables.costBookName}},\n  \"periodName\": {{$context.$variables.periodName}},\n  \"currentPeriodInventoryValuation\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].InventoryValue}},\n  \"priorPeriodInventoryValuation\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_PERIOD_INVENTORY_VALUATION.$output.items[0].InventoryValue}},\n  \"priorYearPeriodInventoryValuation\": {{$context.$nodes.GET_PRIOR_YEAR_PERIOD_INVENTORY_VALUATION_SUMMARY.$output.items[0].InventoryValue}}\n}\n\nFor all numeric amounts inside {{$context.$app.$OraCommParamsToFill}}:\n- Format using K/M/B units only.\n- Currency must be uppercase USD or EUR only.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON (no markdown, no explanation, no extra text)."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare App Context",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let retValue=null;\nif ($context.$variables.costOrgName != null)  {\n\nretValue= \"Cost Organization: \"+ $context.$variables.costOrgName+\", Cost Book: \"+ $context.$variables.costBookName +\", Period: \"+ $context.$variables.periodName ; \n}\n return retValue;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776461655746"
          },
          "code": "PREPARE_APP_CONTEXT",
          "id": "1776461582578",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Check If First Week or Period Closed",
            "returnType": "boolean",
            "sourceCode": "const start = new Date($context.$variables.periodStartDate); \nconst end = new Date($context.$variables.periodEndDate); \nconst current = new Date($context.$system.$currentDate);\nconst periodStatus = $context.$variables.periodStatusCode;\n//const current = new Date(\"2026-05-28\");\n//const periodStatus = \"C\";\n\nif (isNaN(start.getTime()) || isNaN(end.getTime())  || isNaN(current.getTime())) {\n  return false;\n}\n\nstart.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\nend.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\ncurrent.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\n\nconst daysDifference =\n  (current.getTime() - start.getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24);\n\nreturn (periodStatus === \"C\" || periodStatus === \"F\"  || (daysDifference >= 0 && daysDifference <= 6)\n)"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777465712337"
          },
          "code": "CHECK_IF_FIRST_WEEK",
          "id": "1777390670193",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Initial Actions",
            "returnType": "array",
            "sourceCode": "const periodName = $context.$variables.periodName;\nconst s = $context.$variables.inventorySummary;\nconst last = s?.LastSummarizedDate ?? null;\nconst lastMs = last ? Date.parse(last) : NaN;\n\nconst runCostProcess =\n  !s ||\n  !last ||\n  String(last).trim() === \"\" ||\n  (!Number.isNaN(lastMs) && (Date.now() - lastMs) > 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000);\n\nconst runCreateAccounting =\n  s &&\n  String(s.AccountedMatch ?? \"\").trim().toUpperCase() === \"N\";\n\nconst priorityActionForCostProcessing = {\n  title: `Run Cost Processing for ${periodName}`,\n  description: `Run processing to process pending and errored transactions for period ${periodName}`,\n  buttonText: \"Run Cost Processing\",\n  command: `ora.Agent(\"Run_Cost_process\")`,\n  priority: false,\n};\n\nconst priorityActionForCreateAccounting = {\n  title: `Run Create Accounting for ${periodName}`,\n  description: `Run accounting to account pending transactions for period ${periodName}`,\n  buttonText: \"Run Create Accounting\",\n  command: `ora.Agent(\"Run_Create_Accounting\")`,\n  priority: false,\n};\n\nconst actions = [];\n\nif (runCreateAccounting) actions.push(priorityActionForCreateAccounting);\n\nreturn actions;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1760724234152"
          },
          "code": "GENERATE_INITIAL_ACTIONS",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1760724234152",
          "id": "1777961233678",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract user message for query",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "// Fusion AI Studio - Preprocessing node\n// Purpose: deterministically extract item text and build query params without LLM rewriting.\n\nconst inputMessage = ($context.$system?.$inputMessage || \"\").toString();\n\n// 1) Extract requested item (immutable, exact characters preserved)\nlet requestedItemRaw = null;\n\n// Priority 1: first double-quoted token\nconst quotedMatch = inputMessage.match(/\"([^\"]+)\"/);\nif (quotedMatch && quotedMatch[1]) {\n  requestedItemRaw = quotedMatch[1]; // exact inside quotes\n} else {\n  // Priority 2: text after \"inventory item\"\n  const invItemMatch = inputMessage.match(/inventory item\\s+([^,.;\\n]+)/i);\n  if (invItemMatch && invItemMatch[1]) {\n    requestedItemRaw = invItemMatch[1].trim(); // trim edges only\n  }\n}\n\n// 2) Extract valuation unit (optional)\nlet requestedValuationUnitRaw = null;\nconst vuMatch = inputMessage.match(/valuation unit\\s+([^,.;\\n]+)/i);\nif (vuMatch && vuMatch[1]) {\n  requestedValuationUnitRaw = vuMatch[1].trim();\n}\n\n// 3) Resolve sort criteria\nconst msg = inputMessage.toLowerCase();\nlet pSortCriteria = \"AbsoluteCurrentPeriodActivity:desc\";\nif (/\\bleast\\b.*\\bactivity\\b|\\blowest\\b.*\\bactivity\\b/.test(msg)) {\n  pSortCriteria = \"AbsoluteCurrentPeriodActivity:asc\";\n} else if (/\\btop\\b.*\\binventory value\\b|\\bhighest\\b.*\\binventory value\\b/.test(msg)) {\n  pSortCriteria = \"CurrentPeriodInventoryValue:desc\";\n}\n\n// 4) Resolve count (user number wins)\nlet pCount = 500;\nconst countMatch = inputMessage.match(/\\b(?:top|show|list|give|display)\\s+(\\d+)\\b/i) || inputMessage.match(/\\b(\\d+)\\s+items?\\b/i);\nif (countMatch && countMatch[1]) {\n  pCount = parseInt(countMatch[1], 10);\n} else if (/\\btop\\b.*\\bvalue\\b|\\bhighest\\b.*\\bvalue\\b/.test(msg)) {\n  pCount = 10;\n}\n\n// 5) Build q filters (exact first, like fallback)\nlet qExact = null;\nlet qLike = null;\n\nif (requestedItemRaw && requestedValuationUnitRaw) {\n  qExact = `Item='${requestedItemRaw}' and ValuationUnitCode='${requestedValuationUnitRaw}'`;\n  qLike = `Item LIKE '%${requestedItemRaw}%' and ValuationUnitCode LIKE '%${requestedValuationUnitRaw}%'`;\n} else if (requestedItemRaw) {\n  qExact = `Item='${requestedItemRaw}'`;\n  qLike = `Item LIKE '%${requestedItemRaw}%'`;\n} else if (requestedValuationUnitRaw) {\n  qExact = `ValuationUnitCode='${requestedValuationUnitRaw}'`;\n  qLike = `ValuationUnitCode LIKE '%${requestedValuationUnitRaw}%'`;\n}\n\n// 6) Fill shared comm params\nconst oraComm = {\n  requestedItemRaw,\n  requestedValuationUnitRaw,\n  pSortCriteria,\n  pCount,\n  qExact,\n  qLike\n};\n\n// Return and/or assign to OraCommParamsToFill\nreturn {\n  OraCommParamsToFill: oraComm\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1761325384181"
          },
          "code": "EXTRACT_USER_MESSAGE_FOR_QUERY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1761325384181",
          "id": "1778079837823",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
